ime source\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3f17a01a8beb4011\",\"cmd-72ff96c2b70f4b86\"],\"summary\":\"chrony.conf on node1 sets 'local stratum 10' + 'allow 10.100.29.0/24'; chronyc tracking shows Stratum 10, Leap status Normal both right after initial playbook run and again after node1's restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 configured to sync against node1 instead of public servers\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-35986f53926d4307\",\"cmd-26fda080bf6d4c9c\"],\"summary\":\"node2's chrony.conf set to 'server 10.100.29.10 iburst'; chronyc sources shows '^* vm-rhel7-3504805211 (10.100.29.10)' as the current synced source, stratum 11, NTP synchronized: yes, both immediately after configuration and again after node2's restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Implementation done via Ansible\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3e6720e0241d4426\",\"cmd-6c32146ca4e34558\",\"cmd-a5b2a60a8eb4427a\",\"cmd-2eed3f0e46024e0a\",\"cmd-3f17a01a8beb4011\",\"cmd-c37de53735b24f83\",\"cmd-e1be0c7430c44e81\",\"cmd-35986f53926d4307\"],\"summary\":\"Ansible inventory/playbook authored and executed from node3 (the only node with ansible-playbook, confirming it as control node); ansible.builtin.raw used after confirming ansible-core 2.20's normal modules fail on RHEL7's Python-2-only, repo-less nodes\"},{\"requirement\":\"Firewall fix needed for NTP to actually reach node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3c5c3bafef51409a\",\"cmd-c37de53735b24f83\",\"cmd-e1be0c7430c44e81\"],\"summary\":\"Diagnosed firewalld public zone on node1 only allowed dhcpv6-client/ssh (no ntp), added firewall-cmd --add-service=ntp via Ansible task, folded into site.yml\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c4e484bada8c4d32\",\"cmd-d4977aa2b0c74f22\",\"cmd-33265ad1f3ae4bd0\",\"cmd-48d1506fa8ce4438\",\"cmd-72ff96c2b70f4b86\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 4326d5b8...; reboot acknowledged then connection dropped; boot_id after reconnect 2ff972d1... (changed); chronyd active, stratum 10, Leap No